  "baselineCommit": "84448a7285bfda56aa466b5bf6f1ce374a584e14",
  "notes": [
    "This is a proposed corpus, not an implemented TML runtime.",
    "Canonical cases have exact UTF-8 text and domain-separated SHA-256 oracles.",
    "Scenario fixture patches use JSON Patch; rebuild derived Ref digests after semantic patches. The explicit request-fingerprint-mismatch case MUST retain the changed fingerprint.",
    "Host admission is a harness operation, never a trusted=true field in submitted records.",
    "Evidence/bridge scenarios describe minimal deterministic harness state; expand to full record bundles in PR1.",
    "Scope-invalid input must be rejected before truth-table short-circuiting.",
    "Execution UNKNOWN/RECOVERABLE are lookup knowledge states, not overwritten server commit states.",
    "Typed-comparison cases exercise primitive semantic helpers. Full Claim evaluation MUST enforce pinned predicate types before these helpers.",
    "Normalize declared structural set arrays before hashing: entries/expectedEffects by entryId, Ref sets by id, snapshot frames by tuple. Generic Value.list and expression.args remain ordered.",
    "Baseline includes P9 browser shadow mode. Its MATCH/MISMATCH records are diagnostics and MUST NOT become admitted v1 runtime Evidence automatically."
  ],
